{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for ExamTrackr', 'description': 'Primary container for ExamTrackr implementation: Exam Countdown is a responsive web app for students to track upcoming exams and study milestones. Built with React/Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Supabase, it features secure authentication, personal exam/milestone management, countdowns with urgency color-coding, grade logging, reflections, sorting, light/dark mode, and optional calendar export. The UI is clean, mobile-friendly, and student-focused.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Supabase Authentication",\n      "description": "Students can sign up and log in securely using Supabase Auth, ensuring personal data privacy.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Exam Management",\n      "description": "Users can add, edit, and delete upcoming exams (title, subject, date) stored in a Supabase exams table linked to their account.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Countdown Dashboard",\n      "description": "Dashboard displays a countdown in days for each exam, with color-coded urgency: green (>10 days), yellow (5\\u201310 days), red (<5 days).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Study Milestones",\n      "description": "Users can add milestones for each exam (title, target date, status), stored in a separate milestones table and linked to exams.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Grade Logging & Reflection",\n      "description": "After an exam date passes, users can log their grade and write reflection notes for future review.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Sorting & Filtering",\n      "description": "Exams can be sorted by date or subject for easier organization.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Light/Dark Mode Toggle",\n      "description": "Users can switch between light and dark themes for better accessibility and comfort.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Export to Calendar",\n      "description": "Optionally export exams and milestones to a calendar format (e.g., .ics file).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2563eb",\n    "secondary": "#f1f5f9",\n    "accent": "#f59e42"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The main dashboard features a responsive grid or list of upcoming exams, each card showing the exam title, subject, date, and a color-coded countdown. Clicking an exam expands details, including milestones and options to log grades/reflections. A sidebar or top bar provides navigation, sorting, and light/dark mode toggle. Add/edit forms use modal dialogs. The design is clean, minimal, and mobile-first, using Tailwind CSS for styling."\n}'}",
